### 11. Add EF Core migration

After making all changes, run:
```bash
cd /tmp/sv-2ef9775457ca4a7f855a10bb985ebc1b/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker
dotnet ef migrations add AddShipments --output-dir Data/Migrations
